	<digest>
		True stereo algorithmic reverb <br />
	</digest>
	<description>
		Relatively expensive algorithmic reverb with many tweekable parameters, 15 embedded presets and an internal pattrstorage system. The reverb is modular, with pred delay, early reflections and late reflections all controllable individually, as well as high quality linear SVF filters in both the feedback path and end of wet path. The MSP abstraction does a lot of massaging of the input parameters, so when using the gen~ abstraction careful to study the internal Param declarations. <br />
	</description>
